OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo to bring more wind and
OL,4,Arain as hundreds still hit by Austen
OL,5,Apower cuts
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo will bring more wet and
OL,8,Fwindy weather to large parts of the UK
OL,9,Fon Saturday - a day after Storm Austen
OL,10,Fhit the country
OL,12,FYellow warnings begin in Northern
OL,13,FIreland from 10:00 BST, while amber
OL,14,Fwarnings for northern England,
OL,15,FScotland, and parts of Northern Ireland
OL,16,Fbegin at 21:00 BST
OL,18,FGusts are forecast to reach 60-70mph
OL,19,Fwidely and could reach 80mph in exposed
OL,20,Flocations - see the latest forecast in
OL,21,Four video rail
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
