OL,5,Apower cuts
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Friday, Austen hit southern England,
OL,8,Fthe Channel Islands, and parts of Wales
OL,10,FTens of thousands of properties lost
OL,11,Fpower in south-west England - hundreds
OL,12,Fare still waiting to be reconnected on
OL,13,FSaturday
